WEBVTT

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:35.940
Shinku

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:41.490
The medium...

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:51.320
Lempicka!

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:52.250
Sui Dream!

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:54.290
Oh no!

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:56.990
We're taking back our spirits!

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:07.940
I'm so mad now!

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:10.630
Take Shinku and run!

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:13.140
Human, please take care of Shinku!

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:14.420
Got it.

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:15.450
Jun...

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:18.240
Shinku!

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:24.300
None of you are getting away with this.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:39.100
What is that place?

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:40.600
It's a house I built.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:44.360
I made it in grade school
for summer break homework.

00:02:58.670 --> 00:02:59.420
Are you all right?

00:02:59.930 --> 00:03:01.780
Of course I am all right.

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.490
This is... nothing.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:08.660
Even without my right arm, 
I still have my left.

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:10.100
Isn't that right?

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.790
Even undoing buttons...

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:18.670
Shinku...

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:29.310
I have become an imperfect doll.

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:30.550
That's not...

00:03:30.830 --> 00:03:35.360
I've lost a precious piece
of what Father gave me.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.560
I am a piece of junk now.

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:41.730
Shinku, don't say that!

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:44.310
I can no longer become Alice.

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:45.520
Shinku!

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:48.370
Everybody has imperfections!

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:49.300
I have them too!

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.080
You don't understand!

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:53.700
I am a piece of trash now!

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:56.810
I am no longer qualified 
to become Alice!

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:57.570
Shinku...

00:03:57.830 --> 00:03:58.850
Alice is...

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.660
Alice is nobler than any flower...

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:03.690
Purer than any jewel.

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:05.310
She is absolutely unspoiled.

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:06.320
A perfect girl!

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:09.610
I am not like you humans.

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:12.320
I am a doll that must be perfect.

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:16.490
No one wants a doll that has
become a piece of junk.

00:04:16.490 --> 00:04:21.560
Shinku, I don't think of you as
a doll that's lacking in any way.

00:04:21.770 --> 00:04:23.980
Even if you were missing something...

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.740
I'd fill that void somehow!

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:30.310
Don't cry anymore.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:35.240
You're very important to me.

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:39.340
I told you, didn't I?

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:42.890
That I'd protect you.

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:45.800
Wait right here.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.220
Jun...

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:14.580
Jun...

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:18.960
There is a change taking 
place in Jun's heart...

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:24.920
Hina-chan!

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.830
Suiseiseki-chan! Souseiseki-chan!

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:30.320
This is bad!

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:31.930
Souseiseki!

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:35.370
Sui Dream!

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:53.010
That just leaves Shinku...

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.120
Jun...

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.500
It should be around here.

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:14.410
Found it!

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.610
<i>Did you hear about Jun Sakurada?</i>

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:25.820
<i>He failed to get into his 
middle school of choice.</i>

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:26.650
<i>What is this?</i>

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.060
<i>That's right!
What is this?</i>

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:31.370
<i>They said he was a genius,
but there wasn't much to that.</i>

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:33.360
<i>You can't do anything, right?</i>

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:35.530
<i>What a jerk.</i>

00:06:34.420 --> 00:06:35.530
<i>Not again!</i>

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:37.000
Damn it!

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:38.790
Stop it!

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:43.410
This is the spring of memories.

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:44.450
What?

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:49.470
Your memories and your past
that you find painful...

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:52.360
I wonder if you can make 
your way through it?

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:53.480
Damn it!

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:56.710
<i>I thought you were smarter than that.</i>

00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:57.480
Shut up!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:00.030
You all be quiet!

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:04.460
Do you want me to help you?

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:05.590
It's simple.

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:08.690
You just have to
tell me where Shinku is.

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:09.990
Shinku...

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:17.750
Like hell... 
I'd tell you!

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:19.860
I told you, didn't I?

00:07:20.860 --> 00:07:21.910
That I'd...

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:24.480
protect Shinku!

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:27.920
You're not very endearing.

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:30.910
There's no way you could do that anyway.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:42.190
Shinku!

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:49.410
You brat!

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:53.100
Shinku!

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:55.060
Shinku!

00:08:03.820 --> 00:08:04.980
It's no use.

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:06.580
You can't do anything.

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:22.570
What?

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:27.020
I probably look like an idiot to you.

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:30.910
Doing something like this
when I have nothing to gain.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.370
I used to think that way too.

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:35.240
It's meaningless.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:36.610
Doing things
was a waste of time.

00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:38.380
That's how I used to think.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:43.320
But she doesn't even know if there's
any meaning to her battle...

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:44.650
and yet she's continued to fight.

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:47.500
For a lot longer than I have.

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:49.660
Believing that it has meaning.

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:52.420
So... I will too!

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:58.230
Impossible!

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:05.920
It can't be...

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:09.340
How could a mere human thwart my attack?

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.640
We are inside Jun's dream.

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:18.580
Depending on his state of mind,
he can prevail over anything.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:19.720
Shinku!

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:24.920
For the first time, you've been useful
to me as a servant, Jun.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:26.420
Shinku...

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:47.250
My arm...

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:49.120
That's absurd!

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:51.920
He can repair what was once broken?

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:55.140
Unless it was Father, 
something like that...

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:57.660
Only a Maestro should 
be able to do that!

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.460
And this human managed to do it?

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:05.410
Jun.

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:13.370
The time has come to 
settle this, Suigintou.

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:37.480
Jun, stay back.

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:38.400
But...

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:41.030
I will not lose as long as I have you.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:43.730
Watch me from back there.

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:47.650
All right.

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:05.250
Shinku!

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:11.120
Shinku!

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:25.920
Holie!

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:45.650
Shinku...

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:48.630
You have no medium.

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:51.020
You cannot win against me.

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:53.300
Stop this now.

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:55.600
This fight is over.

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:56.690
Shut up!

00:11:56.930 --> 00:11:57.810
Be quiet!

00:11:58.500 --> 00:11:59.620
I am...

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:02.960
I am going to become Alice.

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:04.780
Become Alice...

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:07.010
Jun, get behind me.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:08.780
Shinku!

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:17.560
It is over, Suigintou.

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:37.880
Suigintou...

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:40.650
I am...

00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:44.050
I am not broken.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:46.430
I am not junk.

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:48.890
I am not junk.

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:51.800
Why is her torso...

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:54.250
She is an incomplete work.

00:12:55.130 --> 00:12:59.500
Father was in the middle of creating her
when he vanished.

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:02.400
Father...

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.400
Why?

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:05.740
Why did you...

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:11.380
When I love you so much...

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:21.630
No matter what...
 I will... become Alice...

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:23.720
I will become Alice and...

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:26.460
I will see Father...

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:29.890
I will become the perfect doll...

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:33.800
Father...

00:13:39.390 --> 00:13:44.880
Suigintou sought to become Alice
because she wanted Father's love.

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:49.430
It was that desire alone that allowed her
to act without a medium.

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:52.260
That's why she wanted
to destroy everyone else...

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:56.450
...so she could tell her father
that she was the truly perfect doll.

00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:58.250
Yes.

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:04.710
Her feelings for Father may
have been the purest of all of us.

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:08.200
But that ended up turning into madness.

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.310
So this is Jun-kun's tree?

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.040
Yes, it is.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.440
It's as small as ever.

00:14:21.440 --> 00:14:25.800
I'll use these shears to trim the
bothersome grass that's clinging to it.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.730
And Suiseiseki will water it.

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:28.820
Once we do...

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:30.670
Souseiseki-chan...

00:14:30.670 --> 00:14:31.550
Yes?

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:33.980
Why don't we leave it the way it is?

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.290
What? But...

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:39.280
This tree must grow very large.

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:42.800
It'll have to deal with the
surrounding grass on its own.

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:46.020
You can do it,
 right, Jun-kun?

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:52.100
I understand.

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:53.780
Lempicka?

00:14:57.760 --> 00:14:59.610
Come on, let's head back first.

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:01.120
What about Jun and Shinku?

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:03.820
Those two will be all right.

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:07.770
After all, there is all 
this light coming through.

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:27.670
As I thought,
 those fingers are magical.

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:29.010
That's not true.

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:32.250
I mean because they bring
such a sense of happiness.

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:39.780
If I become Alice...

00:15:39.780 --> 00:15:43.090
I would like you to make
an exquisite robe for me then.

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:45.690
I can't make something that grand.

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.120
Yes, you can.

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:51.280
In time, you will be able
to make anything you want.

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:55.510
There.

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:58.660
Here.

00:15:58.660 --> 00:15:59.370
What's that?

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:01.660
Can't you tell by looking?

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:04.080
Brush my hair and do it up for me.

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:05.110
Why me?

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:09.350
A lady only allows people she
trusts completely to touch her hair.

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:11.290
You should feel honored.

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:27.300
You know, Jun...

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:31.940
This is what is in your heart right now.

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:35.060
The sky has become very beautiful...

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:37.170
...but even that will 
not stay clear forever.

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:41.910
At times, it will rain, and
there will be raging storms.

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:45.960
The landscape will 
change, and sometimes...

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:48.240
there will be no turning back
if you leave matters alone.

00:16:50.510 --> 00:16:54.230
Each time that happens,
you will have to continue to fight.

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:55.540
For that is...

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:58.130
For that is what it means to live.

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:01.590
Good boy, Jun.

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:14.640
I will be going now.

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:15.960
Going?

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:17.880
Where?

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:22.040
Your regard for me has definitely
left an impression in here.

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.120
So don't forget it either, Jun.

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:29.620
I am Shinku.

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:33.260
The proud fifth Rozen Maiden doll.

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:37.660
And also, the doll happy to be yours.

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:40.850
Shinku...

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:47.320
Shinku?

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:50.850
Shinku...

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:55.350
Shinku...

00:17:56.530 --> 00:17:57.250
Shinku!

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:00.860
Shinku! Shinku!

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:32.150
Oh, Jun-kun.

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:34.390
Go call Shinku-chan and Hina-chan over.

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:36.120
We need to hurry up and eat.

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:37.390
They went out.

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:37.890
What?

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:41.130
Far, far away.

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:43.860
I see...

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:49.600
Hey, what about my share?

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:51.810
Um...

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:53.340
Well...

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:54.840
Yours?

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:57.110
You're hopeless.

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:58.850
Have it ready
by the time I get back.

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:01.540
Jun-kun, where are you going?

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:05.750
For a walk.

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:30.600
Oh! Welcome back!

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.190
Why are you guys...

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:38.250
Jun, you were far too 
late in coming home.

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:39.860
Hurry up and make tea for me.

00:20:40.180 --> 00:20:41.470
Hold on a second!

00:20:41.470 --> 00:20:43.210
Didn't you guys go away?

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:45.450
No one ever said anything of the sort.

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:47.250
What?

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:51.260
I so cannot take this anymore!

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:52.370
I am running away from home!

00:20:52.370 --> 00:20:53.520
You rotten doll...

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:57.660
Suiseiseki, you're the one
in the wrong in this case!

00:20:57.660 --> 00:21:00.400
Yay! The train is in service!

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:02.340
Jun, it's cold.

00:21:02.340 --> 00:21:03.400
Close the window for me.

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:05.900
You guys...

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:09.200
Everyone, Detective Kun-kun 
is about to start!

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:10.940
Okay!

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:14.370
The ring was gone until just now.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:17.470
We used too much of our power...

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:20.060
...and for a time, 
the ring nearly vanished.

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:23.620
But your strength as a human grew,
and thanks to that...

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:29.990
the ring regained its brilliance,
and I was able to return here.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:32.770
Jun, I owe it to you.

00:21:37.180 --> 00:21:38.000
Jun?

00:21:43.340 --> 00:21:44.780
Pick me up.

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:48.660
Like this?

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:49.700
Yes.

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:53.490
Hurry, or Detective Kun-kun will start.

00:21:53.490 --> 00:21:54.570
Yes, yes.

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:55.870
You need only say "yes" once.

00:21:55.870 --> 00:21:56.990
Yes, yes, yes, yes...

00:21:56.990 --> 00:21:59.050
Ow! Why, you!

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:10.510
Sakurada
